      "label": "Revised design: kd & ki",
      "notes": "Cut kd 0.05 to 0.02 to limit derivative kicks, lowered kp 6 to 5 to reduce slalom weaving, raised ki 0.1 to 0.3 so the integral can cancel the motor mismatch, and base_speed 1.8 to 1.9 for pace. Geometry is unchanged. Expected effects are estimates, not measured values, since no telemetry exists yet."
    }
  }
